Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030, 0035)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, Alina, Zero Amamiya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:45.28,general text,,0,0,0,,What if I don’t mind dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:48.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Can I continue to love you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.87,0:00:53.00,general text,,0,0,0,,In other words, I’m ready to risk everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:55.75,general text,,0,0,0,,so that we can be together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.09,0:00:59.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll do it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.30,0:01:03.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Do the same, stick to your confession
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Love me to death
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:23.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, don’t look at me like that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.03,0:01:27.24,general text,,0,0,0,,If you look at it like that, no one will believe your words
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:29.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Then, master,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:34.00,general text,,0,0,0,,how can I make sure everyone believes in my love?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:36.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, first of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.25,0:01:40.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Your view is not suitable at all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.76,0:01:44.13,general text,,0,0,0,,There should be tenderness in the gaze
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.55,0:01:47.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I think this is impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.97,0:01:50.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you say you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:54.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I should have said that you like me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:58.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Suppose I look tenderly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.52,general text,,0,0,0,,and love you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.61,0:02:02.69,general text,,0,0,0,,What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:04.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Later?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:07.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I love you blindly,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.11,0:02:09.91,general text,,0,0,0,,while maid Kim is desperately trying to marry you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:14.16,general text,,0,0,0,,What will happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.83,0:02:18.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I’m not going to get married
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:19.75,general text,,0,0,0,,He’s not going to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.84,0:02:22.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that why you refused chastity tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.05,0:02:28.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I understand correctly what you are asking for
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:31.31,general text,,0,0,0,,some kind of promise or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.39,0:02:33.27,general text,,0,0,0,,If I love you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:36.81,general text,,0,0,0,,which means I must be sure that you are mine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:43.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Let’s not rush things
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.11,0:02:44.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:48.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is it so difficult with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.91,0:02:51.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I just asked you not to rush
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.53,0:02:54.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to the maid Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:55.62,general text,,0,0,0,,You take a look
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.54,0:02:57.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:00.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Tender glance, so that you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:02.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I will look at you like you are a lousy dog
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:04.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:05.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:09.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I forgot to say something important
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.14,0:03:11.93,general text,,0,0,0,,It was a dog
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:14.06,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:17.35,general text,,0,0,0,,The dog that was with Master Li in Danhyangk. Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:19.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Sapsari?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.31,0:03:20.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.77,0:03:23.02,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Gwigu
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.07,0:03:30.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li knew from the very beginning that you were a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.74,0:03:31.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:34.62,general text,,0,0,0,,he even knows that you are Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.17,0:03:51.76,general text,,0,0,0,,What brought the head of Jinyeowon at such an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:03:58.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I probably came for you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.98,0:04:01.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:04.65,general text,,0,0,0,,you took Gwiga, a relic of Jinyovon, to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.73,0:04:07.53,general text,,0,0,0,,We were looking for traces of dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:12.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m warning you: it’s better not to involve Jinyeowon in any business with the nomads
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.20,0:04:14.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Why does Pine Forest use Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:18.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Mages of the Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:20.33,general text,,0,0,0,,must prevent dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:24.21,general text,,0,0,0,,And Jinyeowon must help Sosnovy Bor in this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:26.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:29.51,general text,,0,0,0,,So you are using us again
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:33.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take Gviga
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:35.55,italics,,0,0,0,,Bring him to me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:39.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Or should I go get him myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:42.19,italics,,0,0,0,,Gwigu here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.61,0:04:55.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwigu is a relic created by master So Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.91,0:04:57.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor has the same rights to it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.58,0:04:59.87,general text,,0,0,0,,What rights do you have to the Jinyeowon relic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:03.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to say that Jinyeowon is the storeroom of the Pine Forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:05.42,general text,,0,0,0,,That's not what he meant
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:09.09,general text,,0,0,0,,You shamelessly believe that all the treasures of Jinyeowon belong to you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:11.55,general text,,0,0,0,,You take things without asking and don’t return them
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.13,0:05:13.93,general text,,0,0,0,,These are the people of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:20.06,general text,,0,0,0,,You've said this before
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:25.98,general text,,0,0,0,,That the magician of Sosnovy Bor took something from you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:34.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:48.92,general text,,0,0,0,,He's right in front of me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:52.59,general text,,0,0,0,,He infiltrated Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.34,general text,,0,0,0,,and stole Gwiga
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.43,0:05:59.72,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you call Master Li a thief?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.81,0:06:02.68,general text,,0,0,0,,What else would you call someone who steals someone else’s property?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.35,0:06:05.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother, please
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:09.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li moved Gwigu's soul from the broken urn
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:11.65,general text,,0,0,0,,into the body of a dog
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:13.57,italics,,0,0,0,,And they smashed that trash can in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:14.82,italics,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.55,0:07:18.26,general text,,0,0,0,,He's dead, master
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:23.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I protected my daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:27.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li, did you order Gwig to attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.27,0:07:29.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwigu attacked because he sensed dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.98,0:07:35.32,general text,,0,0,0,,This means,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:39.11,general text,,0,0,0,,that young Miss Jin is somehow connected with her
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.29,0:07:50.00,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Probably all because of that worm with dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:58.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Miss Jin,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.01,0:08:00.13,general text,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:02.59,general text,,0,0,0,,used dark magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.81,0:08:11.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Dark magic? What nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:12.35,general text,,0,0,0,,If not,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:14.77,general text,,0,0,0,,why did Gwigu attack her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:18.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor is now trying to slander my daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:19.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:22.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li is right
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:27.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Recently
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:31.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I used dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.63,0:08:41.38,general text,,0,0,0,,But I didn’t harm anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:51.60,general text,,0,0,0,,This is very popular now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:56.57,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a talisman for a love spell so that your lover loves you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.53,0:09:04.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I think that's the point
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:15.13,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems our daughter has caused a misunderstanding
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:16.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.07,0:09:43.86,general text,,0,0,0,,You lived in the body of this dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:46.49,general text,,0,0,0,,and now he has left us
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.25,0:09:58.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwigu is no longer with us
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:02.09,general text,,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:06.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it my fault that Gwigu died?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:07.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Cho Young!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:10.64,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you disgrace Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.04,0:10:36.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwigu died?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:38.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:41.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li said he would bury him tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:44.71,voiceover,,0,0,0,,So it was Gwigu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.26,0:10:51.14,voiceover,,0,0,0,,He knew from the very beginning that I was a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.93,0:10:54.18,voiceover,,0,0,0,,But he never growled at me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.18,0:10:58.60,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Did he cover for me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:04.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Even dead, this is Gwigu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:08.57,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s unlikely that all the energy has left the body. Don't touch
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:19.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Have Jinyeowon's people gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:21.04,general text,,0,0,0,,They are discussing another problem
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:22.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Another problem
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:24.84,general text,,0,0,0,,It turned out that Dan Gu and Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:27.09,general text,,0,0,0,,occur
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:29.59,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:33.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I destroyed the relic of Jinyeowon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:35.89,general text,,0,0,0,,it’s not your fault
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.47,0:11:38.39,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s time for us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:41.65,general text,,0,0,0,,- Let's go\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:42.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Miss Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:45.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Drink some tea before leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:48.11,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to clarify everything, improve relations
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:49.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Relationships?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.03,0:11:51.99,general text,,0,0,0,,They are in love
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.07,0:11:54.45,general text,,0,0,0,,That talisman was intended for Dan Gu,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:57.16,general text,,0,0,0,,am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:01.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm the reason for everything
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:04.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young didn’t do anything wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:05.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Be quiet
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:09.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I recently found out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:11.43,general text,,0,0,0,,He spoke nonsense
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.51,0:12:14.26,general text,,0,0,0,,about what they will be together when your deceased daughter returns,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.35,0:12:16.10,general text,,0,0,0,,so I told him off
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:19.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Deceased daughter? Boo Young is alive and we will find her soon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.69,0:12:23.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you really believe that Jin Mu will find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.94,0:12:26.82,general text,,0,0,0,,He is deceiving you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.40,0:12:29.78,general text,,0,0,0,,He gave you the idea to search Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:31.70,general text,,0,0,0,,at this hour to pick up Gviga?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:33.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you not to meddle in Jinyowon’s business
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:37.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's not quarrel
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:40.62,general text,,0,0,0,,It will be wonderful if Boo Young is found
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:44.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Mistress Jin does not want to be at enmity with Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:48.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's work together
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:50.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:54.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe Dan Gu and Cho Young will unite two families
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.09,0:12:55.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I am against
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:58.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young will find a better party
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:03.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Where can you find a better groom than the future head of Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.73,0:13:05.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Daughter of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:08.11,general text,,0,0,0,,worthy to marry the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:10.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:12.28,general text,,0,0,0,,what does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:14.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:17.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Evil Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:19.87,general text,,0,0,0,,- And I don’t like him\N- Jin Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:22.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I will marry the one I love
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:24.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:27.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I am her lover
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.50,0:13:28.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Park Dan Gu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.47,0:13:35.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's talk at home
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.01,0:13:40.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Let go of her hand and let’s go
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.81,0:13:44.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Let her go now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:46.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Let go of her hand so she can leave
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:49.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:50.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Let go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:00.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Cho Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:03.58,general text,,0,0,0,,If you don’t want to obey, don’t come home
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.76,0:14:15.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I think it’s better for us to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:19.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you come home with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.97,0:14:22.43,general text,,0,0,0,,This time I will not give in to my mother
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:25.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Understand, father
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.73,0:14:30.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll let you know when your mom calms down
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.61,0:14:33.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Take care of her for now
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:35.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.08,0:14:47.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncle, sorry for the commotion,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:49.54,general text,,0,0,0,,but I will protect my girlfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:50.46,general text,,0,0,0,,You get lost too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:03.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Where do we go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:07.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.73,0:15:12.77,general text,,0,0,0,,He said not to come home,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:15.69,general text,,0,0,0,,we can go to the inn and...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.36,0:15:18.24,general text,,0,0,0,,- Rent a room?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:21.78,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:24.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Not one, but two different ones
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:30.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t like inns
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:35.00,general text,,0,0,0,,There is nowhere else to go yet
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.09,0:15:36.59,general text,,0,0,0,,And it’s getting colder
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:38.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.89,0:15:42.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Where to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:43.64,italics,,0,0,0,,Mr. Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.06,0:15:48.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I was told that Mr. Chan was released, but he is not in the room
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.48,0:15:49.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.73,0:15:56.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:01.95,general text,,0,0,0,,- Maid Kim...\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:03.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:05.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Let go, Mr. Park
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.79,0:16:08.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Miss Jin, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.41,0:16:10.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:12.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwigu, who organized a pogrom in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:16.38,general text,,0,0,0,,destroyed by Mrs. Jin in an attempt to stop him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:18.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwigu destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.30,0:16:20.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Why destroy what will define dark magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.26,0:16:22.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Definition of dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:25.68,general text,,0,0,0,,was just an excuse for Sosnovy Bor to threaten the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:27.89,italics,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu is right
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.97,0:16:31.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor tried to show that it is more influential than us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.81,0:16:34.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Under the pretext of eradicating evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:37.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Pine Forest can convene the magicians of the Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:39.32,general text,,0,0,0,,and move the king
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:42.28,general text,,0,0,0,,That's why they mentioned the King's star?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:45.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Warning that they can overthrow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.37,0:16:49.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li started talking about the star to explain,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:52.83,general text,,0,0,0,,that someone like Master So Kyung will appear to protect us in difficult times
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:54.79,general text,,0,0,0,,No one threatened us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:58.17,general text,,0,0,0,,What if the savior wants to rule over us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.05,0:17:00.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.01,0:17:03.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.68,0:17:05.39,general text,,0,0,0,,predicted the appearance of a star
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:07.47,italics,,0,0,0,,Master Li said the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:11.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Does Sosnovy Bor know this too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:23.91,general text,,0,0,0,,At first he took concubines to conceive a son under this star
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.99,0:17:26.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Now trying to find him in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:29.58,general text,,0,0,0,,It is natural for a king to be constantly on guard
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:32.25,general text,,0,0,0,,For the royal family of Go
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.33,0:17:35.46,general text,,0,0,0,,the existence of the King’s star is a sign of treason
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.59,0:17:43.68,general text,,0,0,0,,"Betrayal"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.55,0:17:47.43,general text,,0,0,0,,The people of Deho believe in the power of heaven and revere them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.10,0:17:50.77,general text,,0,0,0,,but a centuries-old dynasty does not change so easily
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:53.52,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s stupid to think that someone will become king
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.60,0:17:54.94,general text,,0,0,0,,only because of the star
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:57.73,general text,,0,0,0,,If he is from Sosnovy Bor, it is possible
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:01.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Master So Kyung saved the world two hundred years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.49,0:18:06.74,general text,,0,0,0,,They still honor him in Deho
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.20,0:18:10.87,general text,,0,0,0,,If someone was born under the same star as Master So Kyung,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.95,0:18:15.62,general text,,0,0,0,,this will be enough to take the throne
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.50,0:18:19.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:23.09,general text,,0,0,0,,are the king’s experiences not groundless?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.63,0:18:27.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:32.56,general text,,0,0,0,,As long as I’m here, this won’t happen
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:38.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:43.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I will not be as stupid as my father and live in eternal fear
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.53,0:18:49.91,general text,,0,0,0,,When I brought Gwiga to the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.66,0:18:52.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I realized that you were right
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.66,0:18:55.91,general text,,0,0,0,,The Queen is on Jin Mu's side
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:18:59.96,general text,,0,0,0,,We can’t provoke the royal family yet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:02.38,general text,,0,0,0,,If we try to do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.46,0:19:05.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu will definitely reveal the secret of Wook’s birth
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.63,0:19:07.97,general text,,0,0,0,,and will make him an enemy of the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:11.68,general text,,0,0,0,,And then everyone in Sosnovy Bor will become enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.76,0:19:13.35,general text,,0,0,0,,because they accepted it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:15.77,general text,,0,0,0,,We need Chang Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:19.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Only he knows the whole truth
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:22.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Like Jin Mu’s weaknesses
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.65,0:19:27.03,general text,,0,0,0,,How do you find someone who has been hiding for two decades?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.61,0:19:30.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's wait until he returns himself
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.16,0:19:35.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Rumors about nomads spread far beyond the walls of the Deho fortress
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:38.25,general text,,0,0,0,,He will return when he hears them,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.33,0:19:43.17,general text,,0,0,0,,out of fear for Sosnovy Bor and for his son
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:23.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard they were looking for me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.75,0:20:25.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is Master Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.17,0:20:29.38,general text,,0,0,0,,He went to Danhyangk at dawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:31.34,general text,,0,0,0,,to burn Sapsari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.93,0:20:32.84,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.43,0:20:36.39,general text,,0,0,0,,He’s not there? Wasn't he the one who called me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.47,0:20:37.89,general text,,0,0,0,,He
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.68,0:20:41.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Told me to tell you this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.19,0:20:48.44,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Nak Su's sword, which he took from the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.61,0:20:52.11,general text,,0,0,0,,According to him, you are the only one who can store it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:53.91,general text,,0,0,0,,so I asked to give it back
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.87,0:20:56.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Left the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.41,0:20:59.83,general text,,0,0,0,,And he didn’t say anything before leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.91,0:21:03.08,general text,,0,0,0,,You’re not his student, why then
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.17,0:21:06.38,general text,,0,0,0,,he cares about you so much, I don’t understand
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:08.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You didn’t even practice chastity!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:14.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Pak Jin said that you are such a womanizer
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.84,0:21:16.55,general text,,0,0,0,,If you were in love with Moo Deok,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:18.39,general text,,0,0,0,,why did you spud my Young Ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.89,0:21:22.27,general text,,0,0,0,,- I didn’t spud\N- No?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.35,0:21:23.69,general text,,0,0,0,,You charmed her
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.77,0:21:26.65,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you charm Master Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.73,0:21:28.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.57,0:21:31.61,general text,,0,0,0,,That someone is kind to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:33.78,general text,,0,0,0,,doesn’t mean I charmed them
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.07,0:21:38.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Be careful with Young Ok in future
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.20,0:21:39.83,general text,,0,0,0,,and respectful to Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.91,0:21:40.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:44.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li is not as narrow-minded as other teachers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.71,0:21:47.88,general text,,0,0,0,,He is not biased and kind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:49.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I respect him
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:53.51,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t even imagine how strict he can be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.43,0:21:58.60,general text,,0,0,0,,He is merciless to couch potatoes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:22:01.43,general text,,0,0,0,,So always be on guard
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.52,0:22:02.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Take it and go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:10.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.86,0:22:12.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Almost got into trouble again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.53,0:22:14.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I was asked to convey a message,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.65,0:22:17.20,general text,,0,0,0,,when I give you the sword Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.25,0:22:31.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did he give you my sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.88,0:22:34.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Because you are mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.84,0:22:36.68,general text,,0,0,0,,which means the sword too
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.59,0:22:40.64,general text,,0,0,0,,In any case, this means that he will continue to be silent
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.72,0:22:42.06,general text,,0,0,0,,This is good
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:50.27,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I was asked to convey a message
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.11,0:22:57.49,memories,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook must take care of him
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.57,0:23:01.45,memories,,0,0,0,,If someone tries to use the sword, he must kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.58,0:23:05.41,memories,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.67,0:23:09.50,memories,,0,0,0,,he will die too
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.67,0:23:16.67,voiceover,,0,0,0,,It was a warning that he would kill us if Moo Deok used the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.59,0:23:19.01,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,as mercenary Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.56,0:23:25.73,general text,,0,0,0,,My sword, but the sensations are strange
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.02,0:23:29.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I think he let me live because he knows I can’t use him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.69,0:23:33.27,general text,,0,0,0,,So, as Moo Dok, you will be safe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.07,0:23:36.36,general text,,0,0,0,,If I become Nak Su, I will be in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:39.66,general text,,0,0,0,,As soon as I find the ice stone and regain my energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.36,0:23:42.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I will also find enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.33,0:23:45.83,general text,,0,0,0,,What will happen to me then,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.45,0:23:47.96,general text,,0,0,0,,shouldn’t concern you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.04,0:23:49.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.71,0:23:51.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Because we will no longer be teacher and student?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.96,0:23:54.30,general text,,0,0,0,,You won’t need to protect me anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.38,0:23:56.34,general text,,0,0,0,,and I won’t have to give in
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.72,0:24:00.13,general text,,0,0,0,,That was our agreement
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:09.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Then promise me one more thing
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.10,0:24:12.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Out of a sense of duty and loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.48,0:24:16.53,general text,,0,0,0,,and so-called love, can you promise me something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.07,0:24:19.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.57,0:24:22.11,general text,,0,0,0,,If you return the energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.74,0:24:25.28,general text,,0,0,0,,you will have to point a sword at someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.37,0:24:28.12,general text,,0,0,0,,let me be the first
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.17,0:24:32.21,general text,,0,0,0,,If I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.83,0:24:37.63,general text,,0,0,0,,it means the killer took my life
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.38,0:24:42.72,general text,,0,0,0,,If not,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.64,0:24:45.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I will give you another promise
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:49.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Something like a promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.48,0:24:53.77,general text,,0,0,0,,which you wanted to hear from me about our future
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.20,0:25:05.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I will find the ice stone and you will not go wild,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.95,0:25:08.54,general text,,0,0,0,,because I promised you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.71,0:25:21.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Runaway couple
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.47,0:25:23.93,general text,,0,0,0,,will remain
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.76,0:25:28.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Is Dan Gu here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.56,0:25:34.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you let them in?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.77,0:25:35.94,general text,,0,0,0,,It was necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.02,0:25:37.86,general text,,0,0,0,,let them go to the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.94,0:25:41.36,general text,,0,0,0,,so that they build a love nest for the amusement of the whole city?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.40,0:25:44.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.70,0:25:47.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm embarrassed and grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.87,0:25:50.29,general text,,0,0,0,,They are a very cute couple
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.37,0:25:52.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you so against it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.20,0:25:54.46,general text,,0,0,0,,They can’t get married
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.54,0:25:56.33,general text,,0,0,0,,And that’s why you kicked them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.92,0:25:58.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Leave this terrible habit
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.88,0:26:03.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Last night you held Moo Deok and Mr. Master for no reason
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.42,0:26:05.63,general text,,0,0,0,,You need to become more tolerant with age
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.22,0:26:07.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Same to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.18,0:26:11.35,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I love Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.43,0:26:14.35,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I love the owner very much
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.23,0:26:16.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.90,0:26:19.36,general text,,0,0,0,,If Wook, like Dan Gu,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.73,0:26:23.53,general text,,0,0,0,,will love the one he shouldn’t,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.20,0:26:25.15,general text,,0,0,0,,what will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.24,0:26:27.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you be tolerant?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.79,0:26:35.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I will support any choice of Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.41,0:26:37.17,general text,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.09,0:26:41.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.75,0:26:43.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I know perfectly well what’s bothering you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.92,0:26:46.88,general text,,0,0,0,,date of birth, appearance, age and all that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.97,0:26:48.55,general text,,0,0,0,,The heart is most important
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.14,0:26:52.06,general text,,0,0,0,,If you're in love, looks don't matter
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.81,0:26:55.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Even if she’s not a beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.27,0:26:57.65,general text,,0,0,0,,or if they have a big age difference
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.82,0:27:07.32,general text,,0,0,0,,So that’s what you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.49,0:27:09.62,general text,,0,0,0,,yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.70,0:27:10.87,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.25,0:27:17.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Anyone who is not as handsome as Chang Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.62,0:27:20.25,general text,,0,0,0,,and who is much older,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.33,0:27:23.84,general text,,0,0,0,,would still have a chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.34,0:27:26.72,general text,,0,0,0,,if your heart is touched?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.47,0:27:29.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.01,0:27:34.56,general text,,0,0,0,,If my heart is touched,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.27,0:27:39.14,general text,,0,0,0,,it would be much more beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.23,0:27:40.52,general text,,0,0,0,,and younger in my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.28,0:27:56.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I see, maid Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.33,0:27:58.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I understand you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.31,0:28:21.19,general text,,0,0,0,,He was very frank when he asked about my feelings for him
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.61,0:28:24.82,general text,,0,0,0,,And what does “not beautiful” mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.90,0:28:26.90,general text,,0,0,0,,He is only two years older
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.07,0:28:31.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Worries out of nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.42,0:28:46.55,general text,,0,0,0,,How can she tell me so easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.63,0:28:48.38,general text,,0,0,0,,what does Master Li love?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.43,0:28:54.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Is he handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.06,0:28:59.48,general text,,0,0,0,,He is more than a hundred years older than her
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.94,0:29:11.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Pak Dan Gu...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.78,0:29:13.70,general text,,0,0,0,,You little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.49,0:29:18.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.20,0:29:23.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I would prefer my uncle’s hidden wine
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.13,0:29:26.38,general text,,0,0,0,,tea instead
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.46,0:29:28.92,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Already regretting it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.51,0:29:30.55,general text,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.22,0:29:34.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought I could give up everything
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.64,0:29:37.39,general text,,0,0,0,,So I took her hand then
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.64,0:29:42.94,italics,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect him to grab my hand so suddenly
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.69,0:29:46.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I was just upset that they were talking about the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.69,0:29:49.11,general text,,0,0,0,,And I said that I don’t like him
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.73,0:29:52.11,general text,,0,0,0,,And he suddenly grabbed my hand and confessed his love
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.19,0:29:53.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Move a little
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.49,0:29:58.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I couldn’t let go of his hand
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.74,0:30:00.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm just very confused
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.75,0:30:04.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I never even thought of running away from home
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.04,0:30:07.71,general text,,0,0,0,,How long will you be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.25,0:30:11.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I have been told to serve you both while you are here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.01,0:30:15.47,general text,,0,0,0,,No idea
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.55,0:30:17.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to linger here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.55,0:30:21.81,general text,,0,0,0,,If I say that we should go home,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.89,0:30:24.06,general text,,0,0,0,,then I’ll look irresponsible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.14,0:30:27.06,general text,,0,0,0,,If I say that I want to go home, I’ll break his heart, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.11,0:30:29.77,general text,,0,0,0,,- What should I do?\N- What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.48,0:30:33.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is for the better
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.11,0:30:35.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Serve Lady Jin here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.28,0:30:37.66,general text,,0,0,0,,better than meeting Pak Jin in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.74,0:30:42.24,general text,,0,0,0,,If So Yi is behind the murders you are accused of,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.87,0:30:44.00,general text,,0,0,0,,then this is dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.08,0:30:47.79,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t know her, but she knows Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.71,0:30:52.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Why does So Yi go around killing people?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.55,0:30:58.72,italics,,0,0,0,,If the blind girl those bandits were looking for,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.80,0:31:00.68,general text,,0,0,0,,this is the same So I,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.18,0:31:02.93,general text,,0,0,0,,then she couldn’t kill them herself
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.02,0:31:04.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I think she had an accomplice
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.60,0:31:07.81,general text,,0,0,0,,If the authorities take these bodies, they will catch the killer
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.60,0:31:10.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Deok knew So Yi
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.36,0:31:12.61,general text,,0,0,0,,She should help in the investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.82,0:31:15.53,voiceover,,0,0,0,,She doesn’t recognize So Yi
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.61,0:31:18.07,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,She is not the same Moo Dok who lived in Sari village
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.16,0:31:21.08,general text,,0,0,0,,She will be falsely accused and suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.16,0:31:24.04,general text,,0,0,0,,If necessary, I’ll ask her myself
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.13,0:31:34.38,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s better not to interfere. Yul knows what he's doing
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.80,0:31:44.60,general text,,0,0,0,,There will be trouble if the deputy finds out that you are not at home
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.10,0:31:47.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone who knew me is killed
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.94,0:31:50.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll arrive in Jinyoewon - I’ll still have to get out
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.27,0:31:52.40,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to practice so that they believe me
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.52,0:31:54.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Buy what you want
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.07,0:31:56.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I gave you a lot of money
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.53,0:32:00.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's come back soon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.45,0:32:02.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:05.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you use an umbrella instead of a cane?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.83,0:32:09.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t touch
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.00,0:32:12.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I like it so much
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.35,0:32:27.22,general text,,0,0,0,,You helped clear my name
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.31,0:32:29.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy it here
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.69,0:32:31.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Does the Chan family always eat like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.19,0:32:34.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Too bold
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.73,0:32:40.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, madam. I'll cook something else
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.91,0:32:51.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Too salty!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.08,0:32:56.04,general text,,0,0,0,,- Fresh?\N- Salty
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.13,0:32:58.34,general text,,0,0,0,,My stomach is swollen from salty food
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.05,0:33:02.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, madam
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.35,0:33:06.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Too hard
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.51,0:33:08.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Too sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.56,0:33:10.85,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.10,0:33:13.94,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm so worried that I've lost my appetite
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.98,0:33:19.19,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Why is she acting like Uk?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.90,0:33:21.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I have no appetite
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.28,0:33:22.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Is there anything to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.86,0:33:24.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Cinnamon tea or seekhe*
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.86,0:33:24.45,notes,,0,0,0,,*sweet rice drink
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.95,0:33:32.54,general text,,0,0,0,,They are simply made for each other. We should have gotten married!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.62,0:33:36.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Then one of them would definitely die in a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.92,0:33:42.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok, sikh...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.17,0:33:44.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Sweet? Too cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.93,0:33:47.05,general text,,0,0,0,,This is how it should be
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.76,0:33:49.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you screaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.52,0:33:51.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Tired of serving me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.93,0:33:54.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think you're easy to please?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.52,0:33:58.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I become irritable when I worry
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.86,0:34:00.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Being away from home is very tiring
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.90,0:34:02.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Then go home
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.74,0:34:06.49,general text,,0,0,0,,No, I'm afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.57,0:34:08.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Mom is very angry with me
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.04,0:34:13.41,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of daughter are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.50,0:34:15.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I was never her favorite
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.58,0:34:18.75,general text,,0,0,0,,My sister was her pride and joy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.63,0:34:22.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Even though she was blind,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.71,0:34:24.72,general text,,0,0,0,,saw energy and communicated with relics
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.80,0:34:27.55,general text,,0,0,0,,She was not inferior in strength to her mother even at a young age
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.64,0:34:30.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, I heard that the Jin family members are mostly
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.56,0:34:33.35,general text,,0,0,0,,manage the power of heaven, and do not cast spells
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.93,0:34:36.10,general text,,0,0,0,,You saw how I treated Gwigu, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.77,0:34:38.31,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s right
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.40,0:34:40.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Strong Priestess
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.27,0:34:43.69,general text,,0,0,0,,can control the souls of people and lure them into traps
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.61,0:34:46.95,general text,,0,0,0,,- Lure into traps?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.03,0:34:49.07,general text,,0,0,0,,If the priestess traps the forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.16,0:34:52.66,general text,,0,0,0,,even the most powerful magician cannot escape
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.58,0:34:57.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that shamans can
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.08,0:34:59.25,general text,,0,0,0,,erase and change memories
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.33,0:35:02.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Priestesses of Jinyeowon on another level
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.13,0:35:05.26,general text,,0,0,0,,And how did such a girl die?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.80,0:35:08.34,general text,,0,0,0,,She really is incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.05,0:35:12.06,general text,,0,0,0,,She’s definitely alive
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.89,0:35:15.52,general text,,0,0,0,,And we will see her again
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.77,0:35:23.19,general text,,0,0,0,,If she is alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.15,0:35:25.57,general text,,0,0,0,,you will see, without a doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.41,0:35:37.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncle asked about Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.96,0:35:40.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Did he ask the merchant about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.75,0:35:43.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Moo Deok told
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.51,0:35:47.92,general text,,0,0,0,,All because of that incident with the nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.51,0:35:49.43,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.51,0:35:53.81,general text,,0,0,0,,If there are nomads in the palace, they may be in Sosnovy Bor too
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.68,0:35:58.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is the exiled successor of Sosnovy Bor worried about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.60,0:36:02.73,general text,,0,0,0,,- I’m not an exile\N- He already regrets it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.81,0:36:03.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.73,0:36:06.07,general text,,0,0,0,,You were so sure yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.40,0:36:10.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Uka always gets kicked out
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.11,0:36:11.53,general text,,0,0,0,,What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.62,0:36:13.74,general text,,0,0,0,,You’ll get used to it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.83,0:36:17.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, it will be sad at first
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.66,0:36:20.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Only Yul didn’t go through this
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.67,0:36:21.83,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.92,0:36:23.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Yulia was kicked out too
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.09,0:36:24.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Cannot be
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.88,0:36:27.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Remember, I broke the gilded ink stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.13,0:36:28.63,general text,,0,0,0,,and we all lied?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.76,0:36:37.14,memories,,0,0,0,,Uncle will be very angry with me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.72,0:36:38.60,memories,,0,0,0,,Let's hide it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.56,0:36:41.65,memories,,0,0,0,,Let's bury him and pretend we don't know anything
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.23,0:36:43.44,memories,,0,0,0,,This is wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.27,0:36:46.57,memories,,0,0,0,,We must tell the truth and ask for forgiveness
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.65,0:36:49.74,memories,,0,0,0,,Then Dan Gu will be in big trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.78,0:36:54.78,memories,,0,0,0,,I can't lie
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.33,0:36:58.08,memories,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine, Dan Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.95,0:37:00.58,memories,,0,0,0,,We can handle it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.79,0:37:06.46,italics,,0,0,0,,We all agreed to hide it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.55,0:37:08.96,italics,,0,0,0,,But after that Yul got sick
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.55,0:37:12.51,memories,,0,0,0,,I think Yul is very sick
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.59,0:37:13.80,memories,,0,0,0,,I think so too
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.72,0:37:20.06,memories,,0,0,0,,Why did Yul get so sick? What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.64,0:37:24.15,memories,,0,0,0,,I heard he eats poorly and sleeps poorly
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.23,0:37:25.31,memories italics,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.69,0:37:29.74,italics,,0,0,0,,Yul never did anything wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.82,0:37:32.24,italics,,0,0,0,,He got sick, worried that we would get caught
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.07,0:37:36.45,general text,,0,0,0,,We confessed to the whale because we thought Yul would die
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.53,0:37:38.66,general text,,0,0,0,,And we were all kicked out
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.74,0:37:42.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I've been kicked out so many times that I don't even remember
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.12,0:37:45.67,general text,,0,0,0,,But I doubt that Yul was sick for fear of being caught
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.09,0:37:49.80,general text,,0,0,0,,He suffered because he understood that he had acted badly
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.46,0:37:53.63,general text,,0,0,0,,and it was difficult for him to accept this fact
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.97,0:38:00.14,general text,,0,0,0,,He gets lost if he is caught off guard
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.85,0:38:04.81,general text,,0,0,0,,He must have been worried and afraid to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.60,0:38:07.11,general text,,0,0,0,,something wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.69,0:38:10.19,general text,,0,0,0,,for the sake of your friends
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.32,0:38:17.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. I remember it very well
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.12,0:38:20.54,general text,,0,0,0,,It tormented me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.62,0:38:23.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Punish yourself more severely,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.62,0:38:26.50,general text,,0,0,0,,than others
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.58,0:38:28.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of heightened sense of morality?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.54,0:38:32.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Were you like this as a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.38,0:38:33.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.09,0:38:37.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Imagine how I felt burying that stone with my
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.93,0:38:39.35,general text,,0,0,0,,irresponsible friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.68,0:38:43.18,general text,,0,0,0,,We couldn’t even really bury it. We were quickly discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.27,0:38:44.56,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.64,0:38:47.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Have we been exposed? You said, we confessed ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.94,0:38:49.94,italics,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu doesn’t remember quite correctly
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.02,0:38:51.44,general text,,0,0,0,,We didn’t confess
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.48,0:38:55.90,general text,,0,0,0,,San Ho found a half-buried stone. That's how we were discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.53,0:38:57.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.24,0:38:59.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently I embellished it a little
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.12,0:39:03.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought we acted honorably
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.50,0:39:05.08,general text,,0,0,0,,What a shame...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.16,0:39:08.00,general text,,0,0,0,,What to be ashamed of?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.08,0:39:10.21,general text,,0,0,0,,You were kicked out recently
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.29,0:39:13.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Who will be the next head instead of Dan Gu?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.26,0:39:15.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe Sang Ho?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.26,0:39:16.63,italics,,0,0,0,,Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.72,0:39:19.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll be on his side
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.97,0:39:22.22,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t give up on me like that
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.31,0:39:24.22,general text,,0,0,0,,You should be on my side actually
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.31,0:39:26.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on, Uk
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.27,0:39:28.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t really help
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.65,0:39:32.61,general text,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Yul\N- I'm not too eloquent
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.11,0:39:34.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Especially in love
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.91,0:39:44.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course you are both on my side
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.76,0:40:05.56,italics,,0,0,0,,Yul, have you been sleeping poorly lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.64,0:40:08.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Today you can drink as much as you want
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.73,0:40:10.73,general text,,0,0,0,,And after that, get some good sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.06,0:40:14.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you have problems sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.69,0:40:15.69,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.78,0:40:17.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw you wandering around until late
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.44,0:40:19.24,general text,,0,0,0,,You usually go to bed early
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.32,0:40:22.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you worried about what’s happening in Soho Fortress?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.92,0:40:32.38,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I just killed a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.75,0:40:35.84,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Protect the world from monsters -
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.84,0:40:38.34,memories italics,,0,0,0,,our responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.97,0:40:41.89,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Even dead, this is Gwigu
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.43,0:40:43.85,memories,,0,0,0,,It’s unlikely that all the energy has left the body
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.93,0:40:45.43,memories,,0,0,0,,Don’t touch
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.56,0:40:54.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you pretending that you don’t know anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.07,0:41:00.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Like in childhood, when they buried a stone
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.36,0:41:04.37,general text,,0,0,0,,It must be hard for you
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.59,0:41:24.80,voiceover,,0,0,0,,If my strength returns and I draw my sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.85,0:41:30.89,voiceover,,0,0,0,,will I be able to kill again as mercilessly as before?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.69,0:41:37.44,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the killer’s sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.03,0:41:41.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did the master bring him here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.32,0:41:45.82,general text,,0,0,0,,He gives me goosebumps
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.91,0:41:48.95,general text,,0,0,0,,So sinister. It would be better if he wasn't here
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.33,0:41:54.33,general text,,0,0,0,,The guests have already fallen asleep. Go to bed
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.00,0:41:56.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should make a talisman...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.80,0:42:08.18,general text,,0,0,0,,You give me goosebumps...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.22,0:42:12.43,general text,,0,0,0,,and you seem sinister
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.80,0:42:44.88,italics,,0,0,0,,After what happened in Jeonbugwan,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.97,0:42:46.72,italics,,0,0,0,,eunuch Kim is not seen with the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.68,0:42:49.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.14,0:42:52.39,general text,,0,0,0,,They say he is sick and resting. But no one knows exactly where he is
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.18,0:42:56.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Find out as much as possible about him
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.48,0:42:57.98,general text,,0,0,0,,When he appeared in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.06,0:43:01.11,general text,,0,0,0,,when he started serving the queen, there were some strange things with him
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.94,0:43:03.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.07,0:43:04.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.03,0:43:14.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what Eunuch Kim said when we met him in Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.75,0:43:18.92,memories,,0,0,0,,This shaman Choi...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.58,0:43:21.54,memories,,0,0,0,,told you to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.09,0:43:23.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Shaman Choi...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.88,0:43:26.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Her position must be higher than Jin Mu, so she gives him orders
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.01,0:43:29.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.80,0:43:32.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Soo in the body of Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.60,0:43:34.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe in the queen’s body
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.31,0:43:37.02,general text,,0,0,0,,soul of shaman Choi?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.10,0:43:37.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Quite possibly
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.40,0:43:42.27,general text,,0,0,0,,But only if the queen is a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.36,0:43:47.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t notice anything that would suggest that the queen is a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.40,0:43:50.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Checking her energy core during inspection,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.49,0:43:53.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t notice anything unusual. She's an ordinary person
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.70,0:44:00.13,general text,,0,0,0,,So it might seem if she has an ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.75,0:44:05.67,general text,,0,0,0,,The Queen is the younger sister of General So
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.76,0:44:07.17,general text,,0,0,0,,She is Aunt Julia
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.26,0:44:10.84,general text,,0,0,0,,She is in no way related to the Ho family, but belongs to the So family
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.93,0:44:12.39,general text,,0,0,0,,If her soul was relocated,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.39,0:44:17.23,general text,,0,0,0,,now in her body is the soul of someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.31,0:44:20.48,general text,,0,0,0,,It turns out that the queen’s soul died?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.06,0:44:22.52,general text,,0,0,0,,This is impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.61,0:44:25.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Each member of the So family has a Lantern of Life
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.19,0:44:30.74,general text,,0,0,0,,The Soho fortress, which is on the border, is guarded by the So family. They fight often
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.82,0:44:34.66,italics,,0,0,0,,Everyone has their own lantern, which burns due to the owner’s vital energy
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.74,0:44:36.45,italics,,0,0,0,,So they know for sure who is alive and who is not
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.58,0:44:39.79,general text,,0,0,0,,If the queen died,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.29,0:44:42.83,general text,,0,0,0,,they would immediately know about it because of her Life Lantern
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.84,0:44:46.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly, I remember those lanterns
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.05,0:44:51.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Her soul can live in another body
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.80,0:44:57.77,italics,,0,0,0,,As in the case of Master Kang of Daegantonggun, he is now in Sejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.69,0:45:05.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sure the queen is a nomad?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.65,0:45:08.32,general text,,0,0,0,,If we knew about this for sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.32,0:45:12.74,general text,,0,0,0,,this would mean that we have found Jin Mu's biggest weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.99,0:45:18.20,italics,,0,0,0,,They suspect me in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.29,0:45:21.25,general text,,0,0,0,,They will try to prove that the queen is a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.33,0:45:22.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Then what should we worry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.92,0:45:27.21,general text,,0,0,0,,We have already chosen the body into which we will transfer her soul
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.43,0:45:36.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you take her to Jinyeowon without any problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.60,0:45:39.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll bring her there today
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.97,0:45:42.23,general text,,0,0,0,,If everything goes according to plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.81,0:45:45.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Jinyeowon will get their lost daughter back
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.02,0:45:48.52,general text,,0,0,0,,And the funeral will take place in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.57,0:45:53.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Because the queen honors
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.49,0:46:01.12,general text,,0,0,0,,What will we do with my previous body, in which the soul of the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.25,0:46:06.08,general text,,0,0,0,,We don’t need it anymore. We'll take care of him
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.67,0:46:51.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, today I came to you instead of eunuch Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.47,0:47:01.85,general text,,0,0,0,,What a shame
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.68,0:47:06.56,general text,,0,0,0,,It would be much easier for you if your mind left you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.62,0:47:30.33,general text,,0,0,0,,This must be the village of Gema
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.13,0:47:33.21,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Are you looking for a shaman?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.30,0:47:34.30,memories,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.13,0:47:37.01,memories,,0,0,0,,Then look in Gema village
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.59,0:47:40.93,memories,,0,0,0,,Many shamans live there
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.51,0:47:44.10,memories,,0,0,0,,I know the oldest shaman
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.68,0:47:47.48,memories,,0,0,0,,If you are looking for someone, ask him
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.90,0:47:52.27,general text,,0,0,0,,- Fire Priestess...\N- No, thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.48,0:47:58.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, do you know where the shaman Bon’s house is?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.57,0:47:59.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Shaman Bon?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.99,0:48:02.24,general text,,0,0,0,,He lost his powers
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.33,0:48:03.99,general text,,0,0,0,,You better go to the Fire Priestess
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.08,0:48:06.87,general text,,0,0,0,,- I’ll take you to her\N- No, I’m looking for the shaman Bon
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.95,0:48:10.00,general text,,0,0,0,,- I’m telling you, he’s good for nothing\N- But I need him
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.92,0:48:11.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.06,0:48:26.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.56,0:48:28.64,general text,,0,0,0,,All streets are the same
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.40,0:48:35.36,italics,,0,0,0,,I was not going to the priestess of Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.44,0:48:38.19,general text,,0,0,0,,But you still have to pay, since you got your fortune told
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.28,0:48:40.70,general text,,0,0,0,,- Where are you going?\N- Don’t touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.20,0:48:43.45,general text,,0,0,0,,She didn’t say a word that was true. What to pay for?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.91,0:48:51.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you go to the shaman Bon?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.71,0:48:53.00,general text,,0,0,0,,He’s bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.08,0:48:56.05,general text,,0,0,0,,The Fire Priestess is the best. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.13,0:48:57.76,general text,,0,0,0,,"Fire Priestess", yeah, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.84,0:48:58.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.05,0:49:06.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you come for a prediction?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.39,0:49:09.39,general text,,0,0,0,,And what about yourself? Do you want to perform an exorcism?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.02,0:49:12.81,general text,,0,0,0,,What did the Fire Priestess say to make you so angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.44,0:49:16.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t see any luck in ruling, it’s better to go into a craft
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.98,0:49:18.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I am the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.82,0:49:21.53,general text,,0,0,0,,What did the shaman Bon tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.61,0:49:23.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to him. I have a lot of questions
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.74,0:49:27.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.96,0:49:33.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you also looking for the eunuch Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.42,0:49:38.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking for it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.05,0:49:45.39,general text,,0,0,0,,After that incident in Jeonbugwan, he disappeared from the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.22,0:49:48.18,general text,,0,0,0,,His tracks led me here
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.26,0:49:51.60,general text,,0,0,0,,So you came here alone, without security?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.39,0:49:55.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone to know,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.19,0:49:57.90,general text,,0,0,0,,that I suspect him
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.94,0:50:02.99,general text,,0,0,0,,So you agree that he is a nomad,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.07,0:50:06.95,general text,,0,0,0,,and the queen is acting strange, trying to hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.87,0:50:09.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Correct
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.16,0:50:13.12,italics,,0,0,0,,And you? What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.79,0:50:16.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I think we came here for the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.71,0:50:17.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Shall we exchange information?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.71,0:50:20.00,general text,,0,0,0,,A little of each?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.80,0:50:22.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Excellent. Then you're first
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.88,0:50:24.80,general text,,0,0,0,,If I say first,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.88,0:50:27.60,general text,,0,0,0,,you won’t tell me anything, citing the fact that you are a prince
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.68,0:50:28.64,general text,,0,0,0,,How do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.56,0:50:31.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.18,0:50:36.81,general text,,0,0,0,,While searching for eunuch Kim, I came across something strange
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.90,0:50:39.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Every month he left the palace and went somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.23,0:50:42.57,general text,,0,0,0,,He came here
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.36,0:50:45.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I am looking for shaman Choi
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.11,0:50:47.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Who else is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.11,0:50:49.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll say that another time. For this...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.41,0:50:51.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.70,0:50:55.83,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you think your words tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.92,0:50:57.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.50,0:51:03.51,general text,,0,0,0,,- Why are you following me?\N- To the shaman Bon
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.59,0:51:05.22,general text,,0,0,0,,We may not go together
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.30,0:51:08.64,general text,,0,0,0,,But I will make him tell you everything he told you
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.30,0:51:10.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Because I am a prince
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.73,0:51:18.90,general text,,0,0,0,,- I don’t know where he is\N{\i1} - You know everything
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.98,0:51:20.44,italics,,0,0,0,,I really don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.36,0:51:28.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I talked to your uncle and your mother
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.49,0:51:30.28,general text,,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.37,0:51:32.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Is she still very angry with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.62,0:51:35.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Will he really drive me out of Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.96,0:51:41.21,general text,,0,0,0,,They said they would forgive you if you agreed to sign the letter
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.29,0:51:44.13,general text,,0,0,0,,So you agree to never see each other again
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.51,0:51:48.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Here it is
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.59,0:51:52.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is already written there
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.14,0:51:54.35,general text,,0,0,0,,All you need to do is sign them
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.43,0:51:56.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you can return home
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.77,0:51:58.52,italics,,0,0,0,,You can discuss everything first
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.35,0:52:03.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I will be able to provide you with food and shelter for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.40,0:52:06.40,italics,,0,0,0,,if you decide to stay together
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.49,0:52:07.32,italics,,0,0,0,,Now I'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.75,0:52:19.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.00,0:52:26.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.51,0:52:31.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm a little sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.01,0:52:36.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I was afraid that I might do...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.52,0:52:40.06,general text,,0,0,0,,too impulsive
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.86,0:52:45.11,general text,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.53,0:52:53.66,general text,,0,0,0,,just the thought that I will never see you again...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.70,0:52:58.45,general text,,0,0,0,,That's all that worries me
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.50,0:53:02.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t sign the letter
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.29,0:53:03.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t live without you
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.25,0:53:08.38,captions,,0,0,0,,Jin Cho Young vows not to see Park Dan Gu again
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.26,0:53:11.43,general text,,0,0,0,,At first it annoyed me too
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.47,0:53:16.31,general text,,0,0,0,,But I want to continue to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.68,0:53:54.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Negotiations completed
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.72,0:53:57.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, set the table
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.06,0:54:05.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Eat fish
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.32,0:54:13.90,general text,,0,0,0,,And meat too
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.96,0:54:30.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.13,0:54:31.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.42,0:54:35.51,general text,,0,0,0,,We are going to go home to get some things
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.59,0:54:38.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you going to build a nest here for your honeymoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.43,0:54:42.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.73,0:54:44.60,general text,,0,0,0,,But we need a change of clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.69,0:54:47.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you go with Cho Young and bring her things?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.20,0:54:59.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you throw away the paper that was lying here?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.49,0:55:01.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is here
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.63,0:55:09.63,captions,,0,0,0,,Jin Cho Young vows not to see Park Dan Gu again
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.71,0:55:11.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to think about everything
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.46,0:55:15.67,general text,,0,0,0,,If I pack my things and leave, they really might kick me out
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.76,0:55:19.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.35,0:55:22.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.10,0:55:24.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course it hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.77,0:55:30.81,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Do you have a scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.90,0:55:32.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Where did you get it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.15,0:55:34.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I have no idea
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.53,0:55:36.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ve had it since childhood, so I don’t remember
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.61,0:55:39.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Remains like this after a cut
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.70,0:55:42.79,general text,,0,0,0,,My sister had the same one because of me
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.12,0:55:47.04,general text,,0,0,0,,She fell just like you are now
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.84,0:55:57.34,general text,,0,0,0,,A scar appeared at the site of the cut
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.26,0:56:03.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Just what you need
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.52,0:56:08.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I will do my best, father
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.11,0:56:13.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t call me that unless necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.44,0:56:15.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Goosebumps
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.33,0:56:27.87,general text,,0,0,0,,It was not necessary to be rude
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.62,0:56:31.67,general text,,0,0,0,,And why did he throw away such a beautiful silk scarf?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.29,0:56:34.38,general text,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.51,0:56:45.06,general text,,0,0,0,,It has the same pattern as Moo Deok's headband
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.35,0:56:51.81,general text,,0,0,0,,- Has the gentleman left Jinyowon?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.77,0:56:56.32,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of pattern is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.40,0:56:59.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin family coat of arms
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.90,0:57:02.03,general text,,0,0,0,,You are going there today. Get ready
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.70,0:57:03.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.62,0:57:08.41,voiceover,,0,0,0,,So that’s what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.00,0:57:19.63,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Why did Moo Deok have a thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.72,0:57:22.09,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,with the Jinyoewon crest?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.60,0:57:32.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Gather my things so that my mother doesn’t find out anything
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.19,0:57:33.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.52,0:57:37.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I want her to go home and stay there
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.20,0:57:48.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Can he really be trusted? Looks like a scam
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.95,0:57:50.79,general text,,0,0,0,,He’s probably special
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.37,0:57:55.21,general text,,0,0,0,,There is such a fire between you. There's something more here
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.79,0:57:56.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you lovers?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.25,0:58:00.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.72,0:58:05.93,general text,,0,0,0,,My rule: do not make public what you hear here
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.01,0:58:07.68,general text,,0,0,0,,You can rely on me
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.76,0:58:12.52,general text,,0,0,0,,There is something significant between you, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.02,0:58:14.90,general text,,0,0,0,,And he’s good
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.27,0:58:17.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.36,0:58:22.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that you have lived in Gema Village the longest
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.28,0:58:24.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you know the shaman Choi?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.99,0:58:29.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Shaman Choi?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.33,0:58:32.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you tracking the use of dark magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.62,0:58:39.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Not at all. I just heard that she was very good at her craft.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.88,0:58:41.76,general text,,0,0,0,,So I would like to find her
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.34,0:58:46.55,general text,,0,0,0,,She was good
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.14,0:58:49.05,general text,,0,0,0,,But more than 20 years have passed since then
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.48,0:58:57.81,italics,,0,0,0,,Shaman Choi was famous for
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.90,0:59:01.86,italics,,0,0,0,,that cast witchcraft on people
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.44,0:59:04.40,italics,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time to the magicians of Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.49,0:59:08.37,italics,,0,0,0,,almost managed to catch her
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.28,0:59:10.83,italics,,0,0,0,,But she managed to jump into the fire
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.08,0:59:16.62,italics,,0,0,0,,They say that she died in that flame
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.29,0:59:21.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Others believe that she was badly burned, but survived
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.88,0:59:23.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Then your father Chang Gan...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.09,0:59:26.01,general text,,0,0,0,,was gwangju Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.80,0:59:31.93,general text,,0,0,0,,You are looking for shaman Choi because she harbors a grudge against your father
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.06,0:59:35.39,general text,,0,0,0,,due to the persecution of Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.48,0:59:37.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t even remember my father
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.40,0:59:40.61,general text,,0,0,0,,How do I know who holds a grudge against him?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.19,0:59:47.24,captions,,0,0,0,,Park Dan Gu vows not to see Jin Jo Young again
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.36,0:59:51.62,general text,,0,0,0,,You did not sign
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.70,0:59:54.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about signing the paper and going home,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.16,0:59:57.25,general text,,0,0,0,,but that would be a lie
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.33,0:59:59.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t live without her
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.50,1:00:05.05,general text,,0,0,0,,My feelings did not appear overnight
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.92,1:00:09.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I have loved her for a long time, but I have not had the opportunity to admit it
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.13,1:00:11.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I was able to take her hand only now
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.68,1:00:13.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t call our feelings childish...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.26,1:00:15.81,general text,,0,0,0,,and give us a chance
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.89,1:00:18.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Take your belongings...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.27,1:00:19.90,general text,,0,0,0,,and go to Uku’s house
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.90,1:00:22.61,general text,,0,0,0,,- Uncle...\N- I need,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.52,1:00:25.07,italics,,0,0,0,,for you to do something there
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.79,1:00:36.70,italics,,0,0,0,,If this man comes to his house,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.79,1:00:38.46,general text,,0,0,0,,let me know right away
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.54,1:00:40.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.75,1:00:43.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Jang Gang, Jeonbugwan's gwangju
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.34,1:00:45.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Father Uka
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.22,1:00:50.80,italics,,0,0,0,,If he comes,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.76,1:00:54.01,general text,,0,0,0,,let me know
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.10,1:00:56.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Immediately
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.93,1:01:00.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly, I completely forgot
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.94,1:01:04.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Shaman Choi had a younger brother
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.40,1:01:08.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know where he is?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.19,1:01:12.32,general text,,0,0,0,,From that incident I never saw him again
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.99,1:01:16.54,general text,,0,0,0,,But there were rumors that he got married...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.62,1:01:18.91,general text,,0,0,0,,on a woman from an influential family
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.60,1:01:46.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I was told that it might be her
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.48,1:01:49.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is she wearing rags?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.40,1:01:51.86,general text,,0,0,0,,As a child, she was washed up on the shore of Lake Gyeongcheongdaeho
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.95,1:01:54.62,general text,,0,0,0,,She was barely breathing when the fisherman saved her
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.53,1:01:58.70,general text,,0,0,0,,After that incident, she lost her memory,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.33,1:02:04.29,general text,,0,0,0,,but, despite his blindness, he can sense things around him
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.31,1:02:30.32,general text,,0,0,0,,You have a mole here...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.33,1:02:41.04,general text,,0,0,0,,And the scar in the same place
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.37,1:02:47.83,general text,,0,0,0,,That's why they said that you are most likely our Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.92,1:02:49.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Only this
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.50,1:02:53.59,general text,,0,0,0,,this could just be a coincidence. Need to check to make sure
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.51,1:03:02.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go and see...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.98,1:03:05.77,general text,,0,0,0,,will you be able to open the doors of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.78,1:03:17.86,general text,,0,0,0,,People from Jeonbugwan are here again
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.95,1:03:20.24,general text,,0,0,0,,They probably brought the girl again to find out if it was Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.29,1:03:33.71,voiceover,,0,0,0,,There is blood in your body Jin Cho Young,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.80,1:03:36.34,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,you should be able to open the doors of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.30,1:03:40.89,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Try to open them at least a little
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.47,1:03:43.18,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,That will be enough
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.19,1:03:55.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Many have been here,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.40,1:03:57.86,general text,,0,0,0,,but no one opened the door
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.28,1:04:42.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Bu Young!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.74,1:04:45.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Our Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.50,1:04:52.25,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Again. Every time it happens, it's worth coming here
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.31,1:05:09.85,general text,,0,0,0,,If this happened 20 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.39,1:05:13.23,general text,,0,0,0,,so Jin Mu was your father’s student
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.36,1:05:16.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu may know something. Should I ask him?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.73,1:05:18.44,general text,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.53,1:05:21.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Keep secret what you heard today
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.95,1:05:27.33,general text,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t look like we learned anything important, but okay
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.79,1:05:34.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you came here alone, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.13,1:05:35.13,italics,,0,0,0,,So it was
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.21,1:05:38.63,general text,,0,0,0,,But it seems that someone is following us
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.09,1:05:45.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Should we split up to find out which of us is being followed?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.39,1:06:26.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.72,1:07:10.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are you and why are you pursuing me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.73,1:07:14.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm asking...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.06,1:07:19.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.41,1:08:14.95,preview,,0,0,0,,Bu Young, what Jin Mu brought is a scammer named Song Yi
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.04,1:08:16.25,preview,,0,0,0,,Why is this here?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.33,1:08:17.75,preview,,0,0,0,,Real daughter - Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.83,1:08:19.79,preview,,0,0,0,,What will happen to me if she finds out everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.87,1:08:22.38,preview,,0,0,0,,Jin Moo has something that will not allow even Jin Ho Kyung to open his mouth,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.46,1:08:25.13,preview,,0,0,0,,if she finds out about the substitution
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.71,1:08:26.76,preview,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.84,1:08:31.34,preview,,0,0,0,,You must destroy the Pine Forest to protect the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.68,1:08:34.60,preview,,0,0,0,,Calm down, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.68,1:08:37.14,preview,,0,0,0,,Do you want to become a hero with the destiny of a royal star,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.23,1:08:39.48,preview,,0,0,0,,destroy every ice stone and save the world from chaos?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.56,1:08:40.85,preview,,0,0,0,,Is So Yul here?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.94,1:08:42.56,preview,,0,0,0,,He will be the first one I kill
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.27,1:08:44.52,preview,,0,0,0,,Mr!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.98,1:08:46.94,preview,,0,0,0,,Here is a nomad!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.03,1:08:48.32,preview,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook Must Die
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.40,1:08:50.41,preview,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, my student...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.41,1:08:52.41,general text,,0,0,0,,

